OL,3,GNEWSAA1 closed as police examine
OL,4,A'suspicious vehicle'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPart of the A1M in Cambridgeshire had
OL,7,Fto be closed in both directions with a
OL,8,Fcordon in place in the area while
OL,9,Fpolice dealt with a "suspicious
OL,10,Fvehicle".
OL,12,FPolice said the vehicle was in the
OL,13,FGlatton area - north of Sawtry - and
OL,14,Fspecialist officers attended the scene.
OL,16,FA 400m cordon was put in place as a
OL,17,Fprecaution but has since been lifted
OL,18,Fafter "nothing of concern was
OL,19,Fidentified", the force said.
